Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你说松鼠队形呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said "Squirrel Formation."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么可能说什么松鼠队形呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he say "Squirrel..." What's "Squirrel Formation"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 别吵了 该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, chill out. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 准备着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Raph, do that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那样太疼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't want to do it. It hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, do it, do it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我停不下来 快点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't stop until you do it, do it, do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多尼 - 开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Donnie! - Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你定好了 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set it up, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没问题的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he'll be there, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,闻着好香 谢谢你 凯文 下周再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells delicious. Thanks, Kevin. See you next week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 还是老规矩 拿到那盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, you know the drill. Let's get that box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,给我拿来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边儿 - 接着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Over here! - Keep away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 传回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我再传给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right back at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我接住了 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take that. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们来的时间刚刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys. We made it just in time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,反攻啊 快点儿 反攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the move. Come on, make the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Yeah! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我说加油 你们说尼克斯加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I say, "Go!" You say, "Knicks!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 - 尼克斯加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go! Go! - Knicks! Knicks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来个三分球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two points coming up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,投篮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 这太有意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, does it get any better than this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 兄弟 真想到下面去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I want to be down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 就你那丑样下去还不把人吓跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit your ugly self down there, you'd have people running for their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我很帅的 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see me? I look good, brah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, fellas! Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里可是最好的位置了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got the best seats in the house right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要下去看呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone can sit down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拯救了纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We saved this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该出现在屏幕上而不是屏幕后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be on the Jumbotron, not in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一年前 我们的城市被阴影所笼罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one year ago, a shadow fell over our city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们突然遭到了臭名昭著的歹徒史莱德的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly, it was under siege by the notorious villain, Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在他凶恶的爪牙大脚帮的协助下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along with his army of enforcers, the Foot Clan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德占领了我们的街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder ruled our streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直到有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until one day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,从黑暗之中走出了一位光明的使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from out of the shadows, stepped a beacon of hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you see who that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他只不过是一位普通的摄像师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just a humble cameraman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当危险袭击城市心脏的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when danger struck the heart of our city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他以一己之力打败了史莱德 成功地将他送进了监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he sin gle-handedly battled Shredder, locking him up behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在大家请看球场的边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, turn your attention courtside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,本周晚些时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where Jill Martin meets a man who, later this week,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他将获赠象征荣誉市民的金钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will receive an honorary key to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们有请 猎鹰弗恩·芬威克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please welcome Vern "The Falcon" Fenwick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟粉丝们说说 像你这样的普通市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell the fans how a regular New Yorker like yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎么做到一个人单挑史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was able to sin gle-handedly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,并且成功地把他绳之以法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hunt Shredder down and bring him to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 吉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the truth is, Jill,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到了几个朋友的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually had help from a couple of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快看啊 他马上要说到我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way! He's totally gonna give us props.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快点儿说呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes! Here it comes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆和闪电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder and Lightning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 大家都知道我们不可能从这件事中得到奖赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, you know we couldn't take credit for bringing down Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩也只是在遵守我们跟他达成的协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern's just sticking to the arrangement we made with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个协议就把我们晾在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this arrangement has us spending the rest of our lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这高得让人头疼的鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sitting in the nosebleeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让他也疼一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of nosebleeds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干什么 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, what'd you take? - Hold on. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你当心点儿 那是我的玩具枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, be careful with that, that's my peashooter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 脑袋 就打脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hold on. Head shot. Straight head shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,能打中吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准点儿 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想为所有纽约人做一个榜样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I just wanted to be an example for all New Yorkers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,打中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you... Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,该我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn, my turn, my turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 看你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right. You got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢你接受我的采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thanks so much for joining us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,猎鹰弗恩·芬威克 女士们 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern "The Falcon" Fenwick, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 猎鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that, Falcon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, April.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:06:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 没事 我在锻炼呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April! Hey! What's up, April? Nothing, I've been working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 听我说 我正在纽约中央车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, listen to me. I'm at Grand Central Station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟踪巴克斯特·斯多克曼博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}staking out Dr. Baxter Stockman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特·斯多克曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxter Stockman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,15岁麻省理工学院毕业 拥有134项专利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He graduated MIT at 15. He's got 134 patents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,目前是T.C.R.I.的首席科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the lead scientist for TCRI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的偶像 他简直是个天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big fan. The man's a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对 正因为他是个天才 所以麻烦大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, he's a genius that's about to be in a lot of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我认为巴克斯特·斯多克曼在为史莱德工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I think Baxter Stockman is working with Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德 需要帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder. Do you need us there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我自己能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah. Baxter is a softie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记不记得你送我的那件生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, that birthday present that you made for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,手表 记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The watch, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我想用它黑进巴克斯特的邮箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to use it to try and hack into Baxter's emails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 爱普尔 不过如果要想黑进他的账户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, April, but if you're going to hack into his accounts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就得靠近他 - 要多近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you'll need to get close. - How close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你的表要在他的设备三英尺之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your watch needs to be within three feet of his device,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,iPad iPhone什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}iPad, iPhone, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 多谢你的指导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it. Good looking out, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿再聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这边请 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. It's just... Aren't you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我很愿意有位像你这样的女性朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As much as I'd like to be someone that a girl like you would recognize,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是很遗憾 你认错人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you you don't know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你是巴克斯特·斯多克曼哲学博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Baxter Stockman. PhD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,15岁就从麻省理工毕业了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Graduated from MIT at 15 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你在T.C.R.I.发明的纳米机器人对我来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your innovations in nanorobotics at TCRI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,简直太有启发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been truly inspirational for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我有点儿像书呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry. I'm just like... I'm a nerd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别拘束 很幽默 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please. Geek out. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 实际上还是不一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, though, there's a big difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,书呆子不一定幽默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a nerd, not a geek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,其中的差别就好像是指环王和哈利波特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the difference between, like, Lord of the Rings and Harry Potter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,TED演讲和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or TED Talks and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,动漫节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comic-Con! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,斯多克曼博士 已经得到确认了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Stockman. We just got confirmation, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,货物今晚肯定会发出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "package" is shipping later tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,确保他们盯紧每一个环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, make sure they're tracking it every step of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 特雷弗 今晚别再来打扰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Trevor, I'm done working for the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 不好意思我得接个电话 是我男朋友 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have to take this. Really quick. It's my boyfriend. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你有男朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有男朋友了 但是你男朋友知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you do. But does your boyfriend know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,圆周率小数点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the difference between pi to the third decimal point,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,后面第3位和第15位数字的区别吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pi to the fifteenth decimal point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到你真是太荣幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has truly been an honor to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是我们这个时代最伟大的思想家之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are really one of the greatest minds of our generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快看 正宗的西部牛仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, everybody. I got a cowboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看看多强壮啊 是不是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at those muscles, am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一起说 茄子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你们 简直太热情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,防守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defense! Defense! Defense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跳球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 我的脚踩到了一块比萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump ball! No way! It's pizza on my Nike! It's pizza!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是比萨 你看看 看看我的球鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at it. Look at my shoe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么解释 为什么会有比萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain that to me. It's pizza on my Nike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 欢迎来到纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, welcome to New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,简直是太悬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a close call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再找个新地方继续看比赛 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to find a new spot to watch the game now, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是万圣节游行 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Halloween parade, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想参加万圣节游行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted to be in the Halloween parade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该是我们最放松的一天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the one night of the year where we fit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 你就别做梦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, we'll never fit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是忍者 生活在阴影里 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ninjas. We live in the shadows. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,酷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,打扮不错 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦奇 - 又怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mikey. - What's the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的城市 我是其中一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my city. These are my people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,狂欢的纽约城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is New York in the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,简直是前所未有的经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the most amazing thing ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宗旨 忍者在黑暗中行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What part of "ninjas move in the shadows"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你忘了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普尔 情况怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April! How'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 我正在查看巴克斯特iPad里的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, I'm looking at the data from Baxter's iPad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你黑进去了 发现什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you got in. What did you find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 多尼 文件正在删除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Donnie. The files are erasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是启动了自毁程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some sort of self-destruct program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.76,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,正在删除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erasing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,文件被删除前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before they started erasing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经看到了巴克斯特的两封邮件 我猜测是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a chance to read a couple of Baxter's emails, and I was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特在为大脚帮工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxter is working with the Foot Clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德今晚要被转押到纽约远郊的监狱去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder is being transported to a prison in upstate New York tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮计划袭击押送车辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Foot Clan are planning on hitting the convoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把他从警察的手中救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna break him out of police custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,继续为非作歹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be free again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谁 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who, Donnie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,比博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beebs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,都交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样 犯罪大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up, Big Daddy Law Breaker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表全体纽约人对你说声再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of the people of New York, welcome to The Big Good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经冥想了将近24个小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have meditated for nearly 24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,十秒钟之内 你将到达极乐世界 生命将得到彻底的升华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In ten seconds you will reach nirvana and total spiritual enlightenment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,十 九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten, nine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 5 4 3 2 - 快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five, four, three, two... - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我说等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. All right, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人想解释一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does somebody want to explain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅 大脚帮想要劫囚车救史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei, the Foot Clan are attempting to break Shredder out of custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他重获自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Shredder is free,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个城市又将笼罩在他的恐怖阴影之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his reign of terror over the city will begin again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 的确如此 - 那眼下的问题就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Exactly. - Then there's only one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么跟一个愤怒的老耗子在这儿浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you wasting time talking toagrumpyold rat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 别太激动了 这还是个半成品呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, don't get too excited. It's still a work in progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是开玩笑吧 这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 伙计们 还有很多地方需要改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you guys, a lot of tweaking still required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,完工之后会更棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when it's done, it's gonna be amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.92,0:14:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜现在没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no time like the present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,电线就这么露在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these wires are still bunched up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一点章法都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no organization to any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿着红色的 你拿着黄色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got red wires, I've got yellow wires...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看 焊点还没完成呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, the spot welding's not done yet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 座椅也不能放倒 - 多尼 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The seats don't recline... - Donnie! Donnie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 史莱德的囚车在东北偏东7.2英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Shredder's convoy is 7.2 miles east-northeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,追上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们改变了时间表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They moved the timeline up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了 史莱德正在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. Sensei Shredder's on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,实时监控已经链接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surveillance feed is live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,标准的押送队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard transport formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这些家伙真没有创意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are so predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Shredder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你被指控犯下32项一级谋杀罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got 32 counts of first-degree murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是个杀人恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one mean son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这样特别容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take it from someone who has his own problems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,情绪失控的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with anger management issues,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,最需要的是培养一份业余爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you, my friend, seriously need a hobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的爱好是打冰球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself am a hockey guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在冰场上横冲直撞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like my bone crushing on ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:15:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢冰球吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like hockey, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我喜欢自由搏击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I like cage fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,自由搏击 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cage fighting. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别没大没小的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, speak from your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mr. Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是你的忠实粉丝 尤其喜欢你的早期作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big fan of your work. Especially your early stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫比博 这位是罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Bebop. This is Rocksteady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字很奇怪是吧 他的祖先是从芬兰来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's a crazy name, right, but his ancestors are from Finland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错 我是芬兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right. I'm Finnish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我打人的时候 一定要干翻了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because when I start a beatdown, I always "finish" it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 对 我说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Did you hear that? - Yeah, I said it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗 - 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said it! - My man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老伙计 - 抬起那只脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My man! - Give me that foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,给我安静点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Shut up back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真是世事难料 对吧 史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World works in mysterious ways, don't it, Shredder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你只能跟这两个疯疯傻傻的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you get to spend the rest of your life behind bars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一起度过后半生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with these two knuckleheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那倒未必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当心那些摩托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Check those bikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从两侧上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up on our right and our left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,加速 快点儿伙计 快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pin it! Pin it! Come on, man, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快叫支援 - 紧急呼叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get us some help! - 10-13. 10-13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遭到攻击 沿87号高速向北\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are being ambushed, heading north on 87.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,需要紧急支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need immediate backup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,确保门已经锁死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure that gate is bolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,散弹枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shotgun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么没子弹 - 子弹在包里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are the shells? - They're in the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么把子弹放在该死的包里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are they doing in the bag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,棚顶上着火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The roof is on fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样 上了高速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You send us on a highway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,押送地球上最危险的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the most dangerous criminal on the planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,居然不把子弹上膛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't load the shotgun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们上了囚车顶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got bogies on the bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他们打下来 - 好的 按按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's light them up. - Okay. Hit the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,按钮 哪个按钮 这儿有无数个按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What button? What button? There are a million buttons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 3号按钮 - 3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Number three. Number three. - Three, three, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们上来了 麦奇 清理右侧敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company. Mikey, clear our right flank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝我的大号双节棍吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nunchuks giganticus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跟小朋友问个好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hello to my little friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,威力还真不小啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those things are pretty awesome, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 相当不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, pretty awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么呢 快干掉那些乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out of there! Eliminate those turtles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌那些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去好好教训这些混蛋 莱昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not being used to my full potential here, Leo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动 拉斐尔 现在有点儿忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, just chill, Raph. We're a little busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 他们又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, they're coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 是时候清理垃圾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! It's time to take out the trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好好学着点儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让你开开眼界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么需要我效劳的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else I can do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,3号飞机 行动 把他带到预定地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raider 3, move in. Move in. Get him to the extraction point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,离14号出口还有2英里 马上准备拦截\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are two miles from Exit 14. Set up an intercept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么东西 - 是块特大号的磁铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that thing? - It's a big-ass magnet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有恐高症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're talking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到后面去 别让他们跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back there. Secure the prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 那家伙要跑 - 他跑不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's getting away! - No, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:21:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果史莱德大师无法到达预定地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Sensei Shredder can't make it to the extraction point,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那就改变动手的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then we bring the extraction point to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 别催我 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, come on, come on. - Don't rush me! Don't rush me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫比博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. My name is Be-bop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 看你的了 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. It's all you, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to shine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.52,0:22:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 扳不动 - 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's stuck. - This sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是那个是这个 - 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There it is. - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的威力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.36,0:22:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,得提前启动传送程序了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to teleport Shredder earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这样做对史莱德来说非常危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that that would be irresponsibly dangerous. True.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 多尼 让麦奇尽量靠近些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Donnie, you've got to get Mikey closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locking on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你只有一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One shot is all you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,开始传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快开炮 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the shot, Mikey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.48,0:23:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,跑哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.84,0:23:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 不知道传送到哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... Shredder's location unknown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在心里在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're thinking right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想用什么办法杀掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all the ways you'd like to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但那需要你比我脑袋转的快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that would require you outthinking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很可惜 没有人能比朗格还聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one, no thing is smarter than the Krang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真是抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是不小心我的触须碰到你眼睛了 史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I get a little tentacle mucus in your eyes, Shredder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.12,0:23:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you know my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:23:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你和你的伙伴 斯多克曼博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you and your buddy Dr. Stockman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,发现了我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found something of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就是心灵传送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The teleportation device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用它来帮助我逃脱警方的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The teleport was supposed to break me out of prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它能做的事可远不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is capable of so much more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上它是我的时空传送器上的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That device is part of a machine called the arc capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.80,0:24:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,几年前 我把时空传送器发射到地球时空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years ago, I launched the arc capacitor to Earth's dimension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.20,0:24:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 在进入地球大气层的时候巨大的阻力使它分解成了三部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But upon entering your atmosphere, it broke apart into three pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.84,0:24:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你和巴克斯特得到的是一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Stockman have one piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.72,0:24:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,另一部分在纽约博物馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another is in a museum in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.72,0:24:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一部分落在了巴西的热带雨林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The third is in the Brazilian rainforest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.04,0:24:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,找到另外两部分装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collect the other two pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯多克曼博士就有足够的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Stockman should be inventive enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,重新组装出时空传送器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reassemble the arc capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那又能怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.04,0:24:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,能打开时空入口 我的战争机器科技堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will open a portal through which I can bring my war machine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就能畅通无阻地来到地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Technodrome, to Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以携手让地球上的人对你俯首称臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we can bring the people of your planet to their knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:24:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以协助你征服这个星球 但前提是你要帮我解决掉一个难题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will help you take down planet Earth if you help me with my problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有四个混小子会来阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four brothers will try to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turtles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.32,0:25:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们之间的恩怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm aware of your past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.44,0:25:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,给你这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它能解决你跟那些家伙之间的所有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will solve all your problems with those pests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我等着在地球跟你见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把我塞回去呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push me back in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,用点儿力 你这笨手笨脚的机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push me in, you stupid robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在来点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.08,0:25:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,简直笨死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他就那么消失了 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, so he just vanished? - Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我播放一下随身监控画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I run the video from my shoulder camera{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.88,0:25:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管会有干扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through an electrostatic filter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.00,0:25:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也许会看到史莱德到底在搞什么鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we might be able to see what happened to Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.80,0:25:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快点儿播放吧 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Show me something, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来这家伙好像是进入心灵传送状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears to be some kind of residue from a teleportation event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对 通过心灵传送逃出升天了 情况不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, teleportation event residue, man. It's the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,难道真有心灵传送这种技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that kind of technology even exist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.60,0:26:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特·斯多克曼研究这项技术很多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxter Stockman's been working on this kind of tech for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.36,0:26:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我从他的iPad上下载的邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of that stuff that I pulled off of his iPad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,全部是关于史莱德和大脚帮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was full of information about Shredder and the Foot Clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.24,0:26:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所有行动计划都在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like a virtual playbook!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.88,0:26:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特肯定还有备份 我敢打赌是在T.C.R.I的主机里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxter has to have a backup. And I bet it's on the mainframe at TCRI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 我需要装备 拿来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, I need something. What do you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.28,0:26:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你要的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly what you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对方便快捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Totally plug-and-play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.88,0:26:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我去盗取数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. I'll go check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.92,0:26:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也去 战术支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll go with. Operate in support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.08,0:26:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,天已经亮了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun's coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能出去的 等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't go outside. You'll be seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.64,0:26:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,臭名昭著的罪犯史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The notorious criminal known as Shredder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚在警方押送途中逃脱 下落不明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}escaped police custody last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.20,0:26:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他在曼哈顿南部被判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was being transported from Lower Manhattan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.76,0:26:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he was serving a life sentence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,目前正在全国范围展开搜捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a statewide manhunt in progress,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,警方提醒大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the police chief saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.04,0:26:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该犯穷凶极恶 请大家注意防范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he will stop at nothing to capture the fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.84,0:26:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,搜索半径扩大到200英里 注意桥梁和码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Widen the search radius to 200 miles on all bridges and ports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,国土安全部和边境巡逻队的信息每小时汇报一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want hourly updates from Homeland Security and Border Patrol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.52,0:27:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是半个小时一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it on the half hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.04,0:27:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这案子现在我负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my investigation now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.52,0:27:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,重案组警官文森特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bureau Chief Vincent. Organized Crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我有司法管辖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have jurisdictional authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经失去了管辖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forfeited jurisdiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一夜之间让三个重刑犯逃脱羁押\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you proved to be an authority on nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经涉嫌严重读职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you lost three convicted felons in one night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.32,0:27:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德是这个城市有史以来最凶恶的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder's the most notorious criminal this city has ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.04,0:27:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抓住了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we had him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.76,0:27:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,却被你放跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你这辆牢不可破的囚车是从哪儿找回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where did you recover this highly secured vehicle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在乔治华盛顿大桥下面找到的 被洗劫一空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found it under the G.W. Bridge, abandoned and stripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.56,0:27:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有目击证人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any witnesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是按规定程序来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's normal, I'm following procedure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.60,0:27:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可是随后发生的事情太离奇了 忍者骑着摩托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the next thing I know, ninjas on motorcycles just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.72,0:27:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,飞快地追了上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come zipping past!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.00,0:27:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们从各个方向对我们不停地攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're coming at us from every possible direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续讲 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep going. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我从倒车镜里看到了 一辆很大的清洁车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look at my side view and I see what has to be a giant garbage truck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,正要对我们开炮 那感觉就好像是坦克大战一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is just barreling towards us like it is on a warpath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:28:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说看见了一辆全副武装的垃圾清扫车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what was the objective of this battle-hungry sanitation vehicle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.16,0:28:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我也觉得非常奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I'm wondering the same thing myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.52,0:28:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 紧接着从那辆车的鬼脸里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then it starts launching manhole covers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.92,0:28:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不停地发射下水井盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right from the grille of the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,发射井盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manhole covers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.64,0:28:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是下水井盖 而且打的特别准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, manhole covers. As guided projectiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你该去看医生了 琼斯 批准你不带薪休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're taking some time off, Jones. I'm pulling you off the payroll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我没胡说八道 这都是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm not crazy! I know what I saw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我能帮你们抓到那些家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I can help you catch these guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.76,0:28:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我是纽约人 那地方我比谁都熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from New York. I know these streets better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,逃犯追踪第一条守则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First rule of tracking fugitives:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.32,0:28:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不要接受最初导致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take help from someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,罪犯逃脱者的任何帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's responsible for losing them in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是被袭击的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were ambushed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.56,0:28:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 感谢你的讲述 琼斯 - 请叫我琼斯警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for your statement, Jones. - That's Officer Jones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,早晚有一天我会成为警探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm gonna be a detective someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.24,0:28:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等警校下一届招生我就去报名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just waiting for the next round of applications at the academy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.48,0:28:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.44,0:28:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过目前还是该明智点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for now, do yourself a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,追捕逃犯是专业人士的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave this manhunt to the professionals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个混蛋居然还喜欢泡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you two idiots have a favorite bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.36,0:29:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会蠢到跑回酒吧去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're not gonna be stupid enough to go back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.24,0:29:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 那个倒霉的司机脑袋还真挺硬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I really rattled that prison guard's noggin good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看见他摔的那样儿了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that head butt connect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.00,0:29:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听见了吗 我可是听见了 感觉真是太爽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See it? I felt it, I heard it, echoing off the walls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老伙计 - 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My man! - My man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.28,0:29:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我妈妈做的味道一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like Mama used to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 我的三明治呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi, barkeep! Where are those sammies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:29:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 来了 两位慢用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, guys. House special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.56,0:30:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是够慢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有小咸菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a side of pickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小咸菜能防追踪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And are these pickles untraceable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,连史莱德本人都很难追踪 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those phones are harder to track than Shredder himself, homeboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.36,0:30:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最好别跟我们贼眉鼠眼的 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, do not make eye contact with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.72,0:30:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拿我们当乡巴佬呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He think we somethin' to play with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.68,0:30:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,听着比博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Beebs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是真不想再给别人当小弟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of being someone else's errand boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德消失了 对我们却是个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Shredder out of the picture, maybe we could step up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.20,0:30:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可以拥有我们自己的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carve out our own piece of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.00,0:30:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也许还有我们自己的帮派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe even start our own Foot Clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.04,0:30:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们的帮派最好就叫大腿帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually work our way up to our own Leg Clan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 这不是什么难事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, honestly, how hard could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.32,0:30:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德先生 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Shredder! My man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.96,0:30:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太巧了 我们俩正在探讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coincidentally, we were just contemplating a consolidation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么才能让我们的犯罪王国更加强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of our criminal enterprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比如按51%和49%的比例分成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were thinking like a 51/49 split.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.28,0:31:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是你们占大头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaning your way, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.52,0:31:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是来找搭档的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not looking for partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.48,0:31:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来找人卖命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for errand boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.84,0:31:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝对能胜任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we could work with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wassup, drone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.44,0:31:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没吓到你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't scared of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.08,0:31:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,像蝴蝶一样轻灵 具有蜜蜂的攻击性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.56,0:31:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我们回到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every second we're down here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.32,0:31:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德都实力大增 麦奇却越来越闹人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder gets more powerful and Mikey gets more annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我听见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I heard that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.12,0:31:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只要太阳一落山 就是我们的时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as the sun goes down, it's turtle time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.96,0:31:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 在跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, drone. You talking to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没看见有别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't see anybody else...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 斯普林特师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed, Master Splinter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信我 可我却让史莱德给溜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put me in charge, and Shredder slipped through our fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.24,0:31:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们根本没有办法阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing you could have done to stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不用因为挫折而一撅不振\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let this setback distract you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.24,0:31:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:32:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你还是他们几个的领头人 就永远不要轻言放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as you keep the team unified, you shall always succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,警方希望知道逃犯下落的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're asking anyone with information about the fugitives' whereabouts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.08,0:32:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,及时将情况反映给当局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to please pass it along to authorities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.36,0:32:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我再问你一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to ask you one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.32,0:32:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定他们没来过这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure those guys didn't come through here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pal, I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.20,0:32:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我喜欢这首歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I love this song!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿回去听你不介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mind if I borrow this, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.40,0:32:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey... What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.52,0:32:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, you know what? Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这CD划伤了 - 真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It has a scratch on it. - Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,或者再喝杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe I'll have a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是疯了 - 差不多吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you out of your mind? - Getting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.52,0:32:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.72,0:32:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 别砸了 别砸了好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! Stop it! Just stop it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.92,0:32:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,想告诉我了是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready to tell me where they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.40,0:32:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我卖给他们一部手机 就是这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I slipped them cell phones. That's all I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想作为一个负责任的商人比如说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I imagine a responsible businessperson such as yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.82,0:33:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能只卖硬件丝毫不关心如何去追踪吧 那不现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wouldn't sell hardware without a means by which to track said hardware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.36,0:33:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说的对吗 - 行了 给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I right? - Look! Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我有GPS 行了吧 可以找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a GPS, okay? You'll find them with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.44,0:33:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,系统把你传送到哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did it spit you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.56,0:33:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.08,0:33:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,逃脱计划成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The escape plan, it worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.12,0:33:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但跟你设计的不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not in the way you planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.76,0:33:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我被传送到了很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've traveled very far, and now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.08,0:33:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有事情要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫耐斯特德 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neustedder, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫耐斯特德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neustedder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫耐斯特德 请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neustedder, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,发现它的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I found this thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.28,0:34:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我还真没想到它还能有这么大的用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never could have imagined its significance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.60,0:34:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那个朗格指挥官真的说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this Commander Krang,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它能打开通往另一个时空的大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he said that this will help open a portal to another dimension?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.00,0:34:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦成功 我们将跟他一起统治这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we do, we'll join him in dominating this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.88,0:34:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们将拥有无边的权力 - 权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll have ultimate power. - Power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.40,0:34:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不敢想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And indescribable glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将打开连接两个世界的时空之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be responsible for opening the fabric between two worlds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.92,0:34:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.04,0:34:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要打开时空之门 必须找到另外一部分装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other pieces required to open the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.28,0:34:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,为了防止那四个家伙来捣乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If those four brothers are still out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.36,0:34:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要武力值更高的战士来对付他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need to create soldiers that can defeat them with a single blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.56,0:34:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它一切就不在话下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this will help us do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,需要先进行合成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needs to be synthesized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.00,0:35:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个任务就交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is where you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快给天才让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here come the brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,罗克 你看你这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Rock, check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比博 改天我也弄个实验室玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beebs, I got to get meseif one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那该多有意思啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of what we could do with this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好像又回到了科学课上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I'm back in science class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只需要找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all we need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.40,0:35:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,实验目标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are test subjects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,实验对象将对我的指令无条件服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candidates that will easily fall under my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.80,0:35:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,四肢很发达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Large in size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,头脑却很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Low in intellect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.04,0:36:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That stings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.68,0:36:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不太舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not in a good way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.44,0:36:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.32,0:36:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这到底是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is happening to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 不过这感觉很爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, but this feels great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.32,0:36:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这下可有意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.28,0:37:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很奇怪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This feels funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好像吃了摇头丸一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels like I have ants in my pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.72,0:37:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,摇屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big ants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 比博和罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Bebop and Rocksteady,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们就在大楼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're up there somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.60,0:37:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.64,0:37:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,奥姆尼丝 扫描实验对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Omnus, scan subjects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.16,0:37:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,扫描中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Searching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.36,0:37:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miraculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人的体内 都有一组潜伏的基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside every human there's a dormant gene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.92,0:37:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,控制我们不会出现返祖现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which ties us to our animal ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.40,0:37:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来这紫色的药液让他们重新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as if that purple ooze has returned them to their rightful place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在野兽王国找到了位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the animal kingdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.28,0:37:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,罗克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.12,0:37:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你变成了一只牛头怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a rhinoceros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.12,0:37:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说不上是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.76,0:38:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let me look, let me look. I'm a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.08,0:38:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一只小猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a little piggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.48,0:38:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,确切说是疣猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a warthog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比博 - 干什么 罗克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Beebs! - Yeah, Rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.36,0:38:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让你看看犀牛的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever see a rhino charge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.32,0:38:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好疼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.44,0:38:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 感觉真爽 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like it! - Me, too!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.56,0:38:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.56,0:38:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好所有的容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare the entire container.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的战士越多 打开时空之门的把握就越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more of them we create, the easier it will be to secure the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.56,0:38:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.44,0:38:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我的牛角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out the horn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.08,0:38:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 看看我的尾巴 看 还会动呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, check out my tail. Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.84,0:38:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,太酷了 我有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is cool. Do I have one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.16,0:38:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我 罗克 那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rock, who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.96,0:38:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.92,0:38:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把药液给我抢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that canister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是真的想要重蹈覆辙吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys don't really want to do this again, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.72,0:39:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像结局一直都是你们灰溜溜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't usually work out well for you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.76,0:39:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我还有四个帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I have the four friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.72,0:39:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可是忍者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're green ninjas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.92,0:39:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把东西交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us the ooze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.60,0:40:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 站住 - 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop! - Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.24,0:41:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,东西在那小子的手里 被他给拿走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that guy with the hockey stick in the other alley,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.36,0:41:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟这事儿没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have nothing to do with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.60,0:41:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.68,0:41:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么 - 凯西·琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name? - Casey Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.28,0:41:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 凯西·琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - Casey Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.84,0:41:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,该死不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stacy Moans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.88,0:41:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西·琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casey Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.16,0:41:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.44,0:41:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 离她远点儿 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get away from her! - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.40,0:41:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,躲后面 别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back. Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吃我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not eat us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.48,0:42:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.28,0:42:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,地球人不是你们的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of Earth are not your enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.80,0:42:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.36,0:42:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是至高无上的君主派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were sent by the Supreme Leader{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃美味的地球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to eat delicious humans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.28,0:42:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,吃不了的都拌上沙拉酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dip them in ranch dressing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.96,0:42:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.36,0:42:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃素的 除了肉 奶酪 还有鸡蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a vegan. Except for meat and cheese and eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西 他们是我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casey, they're my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.80,0:42:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是你朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.52,0:42:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they're my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来说 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell him. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.20,0:42:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着紫色眼罩的那个是技术天才多纳泰罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donatello over there in the purple, he's a technical genius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.24,0:42:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,技术男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is technically a genius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.12,0:42:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大帅哥 拉斐尔的眼罩是红的 像个可爱的大号泰迪熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raphael over there in the red, he's like a big cuddly teddy bear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.60,0:42:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只可惜这个大号泰迪熊脾气有点儿爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if big cuddly teddy bears were incredibly violent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.96,0:42:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是莱昂纳多 他是蓝色的 勇敢的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Leonardo. He's in the blue. Fearless leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:42:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,悄然无声 杀人无形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silent but deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.84,0:43:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我是米开朗基罗 很喜欢我的橙色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm Michelangelo, sporting my signature orange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.08,0:43:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的优点很多 聪明 强壮 个人魅力也相当不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a triple threat... Brains, brawn, and obviously a dazzling personality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.28,0:43:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 女士们都叫我麦奇 - 说完了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ladies like to call me Mikey. - Are you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.60,0:43:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 来晚了 爱普尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry we're late, April.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.84,0:43:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想说一说事情的原委吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to walk me through what's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.76,0:43:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我一直在盯着巴克斯特 后来发现了史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so I went to go see Baxter, but then Shredder was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.08,0:43:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,听他们说要打开什么大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he was talking about opening up some sort of portal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好像说是通往另一个时空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to another dimension, and then he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.28,0:43:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他拿出了这个药液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took this purple ooze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把它注射到了两个逃犯的身上 就是在他手中逃脱的那两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he injected it into those two criminals that escaped with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.20,0:43:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们一个变成了犀牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he turned one of them into a rhinoceros{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而另外一个变成了疣猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other one into a warthog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.48,0:43:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到比博和罗斯泰迪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have eyes on Bebop and Rocksteady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.84,0:43:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么关心他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you care about those two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.56,0:43:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能把他们捉拿归案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say that I have a vested interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.96,0:43:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说意义重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in bringing them to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.44,0:43:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回大本营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get back to the lair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.72,0:43:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 你跟这位黑色星期五在这儿盯着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph, grab Friday the 13th here and follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.36,0:43:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能帮我们找到比博和罗斯泰迪就让他加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he can help us find Bebop and Rocksteady, he's coming with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这根本不可能 我哪儿也不想去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's not. Not a chance. I'm staying right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.12,0:43:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我很理解你 可惜你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd agree with you, but you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们俩一起分享这个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, we, too, share a "vested interest."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.04,0:43:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你们分享任何事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't share anything with you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.04,0:43:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fellas, fellas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.64,0:44:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约人民需要我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the people of New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.72,0:44:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时抛开彼此之间的分歧 求同存异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}need us to set aside our differences and work together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,眼前的问题只有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which begs only one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.88,0:44:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个之间到底是什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you two guys like a thing or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.96,0:44:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这种药液被注射进了比博和罗斯泰迪的体内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this purple ooze was injected into Bebop and Rocksteady's bloodstream,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.56,0:44:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那就有可能通过同位素的唯一性进行精确定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's feasible that were I to pinpoint a singular isotopic signature,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就可以追踪到他们的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may be able to use it to track their location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.04,0:44:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果找到他们 就能找到史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we find them, then we find Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.56,0:44:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们全送回监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put them all in shackles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.20,0:44:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你说戴着冰球面具去抓他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as long as we all have our hockey masks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.68,0:44:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what could go wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.36,0:44:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑 我居然跑到这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously? Now I'm taking wardrobe advice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.72,0:44:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,跟一群怪物谈合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a bunch of Swamp Things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.56,0:44:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一群生活在地下儿童乐园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Living in an underground amusement park,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.76,0:44:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 名字还都那么自命不凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have, forgive me, the most pretentious names ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.28,0:44:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 名字是我起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, I named them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.60,0:44:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,动出声 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move. Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.12,0:44:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有一只好大的老鼠在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a giant rat back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.36,0:45:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我们以前也见到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we've seen him around here before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要想干掉他只有一个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there's only one way to get rid of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.76,0:45:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放低身姿 - 再低 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got to get low. - Low! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.52,0:45:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,冲向他的时候速度一定要快 才能更有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you go at him, you got to go fast, and you got to go hard.{\r}
