Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你又加上了一条说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now you're adding lying to the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.56,0:52:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是指多尼告诉我的药液的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're referring to what Donnie told me about the purple ooze,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.56,0:52:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是特殊情况需要特殊处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's called "compartmentalization of information."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.92,0:52:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那对我们来说是变成人类的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's even a chance that ooze can make us human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.08,0:52:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是乌龟 你喜不喜欢都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're turtles, whether you like it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.36,0:52:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这不在于我喜不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about what I like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.52,0:52:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是有多少人能接受我们这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's about what people up there are willing to accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.12,0:52:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的接受是由内而外的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True acceptance only comes from within.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.60,0:52:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说这种虚伪的大道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give me that fortune cookie muck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.20,0:52:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做这种决定之前应该先跟我们商量一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should consult with us before you decide to do something like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.00,0:52:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟多尼商量了 我们决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consulted Donnie. And we decided...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.40,0:52:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那麦奇呢 他弃权了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about Mikey? He don't get a vote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个家庭里只有一个人有决定权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one vote that counts in this family!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.44,0:52:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.68,0:52:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,莱昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,莱昂 刚才在海登天文馆有警报触发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo, an alarm just tripped at the Hayden Planetarium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.56,0:52:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得马上过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get uptown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.24,0:52:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,带上装备 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gear up, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.04,0:52:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩留在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.92,0:52:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在报复我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're benching me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.76,0:52:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 随便你怎么想 - 关我什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call it what you want. - What'd I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.92,0:53:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.12,0:53:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,莫名其妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that went well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.36,0:53:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,简直太不像话了 明显是欺负人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nerve this guy has. Big timing us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.52,0:53:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他觉得现在这样挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may be fine with the status quo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.76,0:53:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可并不意味着 我们就不能有自己的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that don't mean we can't make our own decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.08,0:53:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.20,0:53:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait. What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.44,0:53:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说还有更多那种紫色的药液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means there's more where that purple ooze came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我都能拥有一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're gonna get our hands on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.00,0:53:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.96,0:53:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是没明白你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't know what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.64,0:53:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we... Are we doing something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,美国自然历史博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American Museum of Natural History.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.76,0:53:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想来这儿看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.44,0:53:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快四处查看 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quit screwing around, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.64,0:53:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,30秒后警察就会到达正门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds till the cops are at the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.12,0:53:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.88,0:53:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德和那两个怪物肯定在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder and the mutants were definitely here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.48,0:53:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在检测0号元素的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm detecting traces of neutronium,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.64,0:53:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是建立可控性黑洞必不可少的关键性物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the critical ingredient required for creating a controlled black hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.28,0:54:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 黑洞是宇宙中唯一有能力切断时空连续性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is the only thing capable of rupturing the space-time continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.28,0:54:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what that means!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.00,0:54:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不知道 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.64,0:54:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着史莱德并不像我想的是个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means Shredder may not be as nuts as I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.64,0:54:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚才收集的数据看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the data I just collected,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.00,0:54:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我推测在我们眼前的这个东西的里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surmising that what was inside this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.52,0:54:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有能帮他打开时空之门的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may help Shredder open that portal to another dimension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.84,0:54:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我想知道的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what I want to know is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.00,0:54:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果时空之门被打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if a portal's gonna open up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.20,0:54:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,从另一个时空过来的会是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's coming through from the other side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.04,0:54:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是我们要闯进警察总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want to break into police headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.28,0:54:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.28,0:54:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼说需要更多的药液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie said he needs more of the purple ooze{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.12,0:54:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,来追踪比博和罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to track Bebop and Rocksteady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.12,0:54:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过药液现在应该被警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you said the cops would've logged it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.64,0:54:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,存放在证物保管室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into Evidence Control Room by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.56,0:54:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 莱昂知道这个计划吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, and Leo is good with this plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.76,0:54:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这个行动是由我负责的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I'm in charge on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.16,0:54:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这样吧 麦奇 - 是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ain't that right, Mikey? - You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.84,0:54:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.48,0:55:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们能控制电梯和消防门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we can take the elevator shafts and vents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.88,0:55:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个只需要待在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you two to stay on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.88,0:55:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能就这样大摇大摆地走进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't just walk right into police headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.12,0:55:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是胆小鬼吗 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you, chicken? - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.84,0:55:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谁是胆小鬼 小乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you calling chicken, turtle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.36,0:55:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想不想找到比博和罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, do you want to find Bebop and Rocksteady or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.36,0:55:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就去闯一闯警察总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're breaking into police headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个问题要商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got one last boondoggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.76,0:55:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个人来掩护大家避开门卫的安全检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find someone to sneak you guys past security checkpoint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.92,0:55:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的办法是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only plan I got so far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.92,0:55:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法让他们垂涎欲滴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may be a tad less than appetizing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.28,0:55:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是去吃饭吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we going somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.24,0:55:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是猎鹰 我会跟每个人都拍照的 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take a photo with all of you, don't worry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.16,0:55:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚大家都有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everybody's gonna get one tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.80,0:55:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弗恩 欢迎你 偶像 - 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Vern. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.28,0:55:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,粉丝 粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big fan. Big fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.72,0:55:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪 卡梅罗·安东尼 我可是你的粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gosh, Carmelo Anthony, right back at ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.44,0:55:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice key to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.56,0:55:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 这没什么大不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Yeah, I mean, they give these things out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.52,0:55:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,梅罗 介意我叫你梅罗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Melo... Do you mind if I call you Melo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.92,0:55:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.08,0:55:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 真高兴你把我叫了过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm really glad that you stopped me, because,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.84,0:56:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该比我的感受还深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guys like you and me, we're kind of the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.64,0:56:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.92,0:56:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们给人们的生活带来了欢乐和希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We bring a lot of joy and hope into people's lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.28,0:56:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得到的是明星的光环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got that kind of star power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.20,0:56:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而作为回报 我们还应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while it's a gift, this bond that we have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.60,0:56:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这儿呢 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you are. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,梅罗 介绍一下 这是我女朋友 亚历桑德拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melo, I'd like to introduce you to my girlfriend, Alessandra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.96,0:56:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,女朋友 我们刚认识一周吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girlfriend? We just met a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.28,0:56:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.72,0:56:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一见钟情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're all over each other. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.64,0:56:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 别摸了 - 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know... - Vern!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.36,0:56:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我有个很好的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, what might be a great idea is if we...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.24,0:56:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.08,0:56:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我们应该 - 我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know... - We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.92,0:56:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别忘了带上你那把钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bring that key to the city with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你该走了 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think you need to go. - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.72,0:56:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的醋劲竟然会那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, your jealousy knows no limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要你的帮助 - 我们指谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need your help. - We? Who's "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.48,0:56:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的城市英雄吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well, if it ain't the prince of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.60,0:56:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 你歇歇吧 拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Give me a break, Raph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.52,0:56:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当初就是你非要让我出这个风头的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one who told me to take credit for Shredder in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.20,0:56:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 可现在却让那家伙跑了 无影无踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now in light of the fact that he is who knows where,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.16,0:56:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只不过是按照约定接受这些荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am starting to have profound regrets about our arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.36,0:56:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也可以换过来试一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, are we just gonna stand around and talk or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.36,0:57:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这小子是谁 - 同是沦落人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's this guy? - Total loser, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.72,0:57:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说降落的落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, nice enough fella,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,像你这样的能举起哑铃就不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you like guys who can't even bench press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.68,0:57:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.80,0:57:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,T恤有点儿肥呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or fill out a T-shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.04,0:57:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 计划有他一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, he's a part of the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.32,0:57:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What plan is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.24,0:57:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是闯进纽约警察总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plan to break into police headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.64,0:57:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我们要找到史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We need to find Shredder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.32,0:57:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们 不 不包括我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We"? No, no, no. No, we're not doing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.84,0:57:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我很想帮你们 但是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'd love to help you guys out, but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.56,0:57:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要去听音乐会 - 钥匙不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got concert tickets to a lunch. - Sweet key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.84,0:57:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真能用来开门吗 - 不能 这只是象征性的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does it go to something? - No, it's just the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.04,0:57:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 作为这个由怪物组成的团体的新成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, as the resident new guy in this band of freaky misfits,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.36,0:57:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,算我拜托你了 你就接受了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do yourself a favor, and just roll with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.68,0:57:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,新来的 我早就接受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, new guy, all I do is roll with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.28,0:57:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been rolling with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.12,0:57:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还穿开档裤呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since you were wearing baby T-shirts because you were a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.72,0:57:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,警察总部 半小时后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police headquarters. Thirty minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.48,0:57:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一会再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.48,0:57:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一会见 - 他说过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See you there. - He just said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.88,0:58:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.40,0:58:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁来了 弗恩 猎鹰芬威克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who it is. Vern "The Falcon" Fenwick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.28,0:58:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,合个影吧 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take a picture, huh? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.56,0:58:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都过来 我来拍 然后发给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll just take one and send it to all you guys. Just gotta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.92,0:58:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像是全家福一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do, like, a panorama thing there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.68,0:58:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不错 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.76,0:58:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能不能再快点儿 麦奇 - 我在快 在快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any time now, Mikey. - I'm hurrying, I'm hurrying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.08,0:58:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.80,0:58:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 笑一笑 拍的帅一点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, smile. Smile for your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.64,0:59:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟后开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The meeting's in 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.52,0:59:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我把文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.52,0:59:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,卡哇邦嘎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowabunga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.16,0:59:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mikey. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.56,0:59:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 警报 - 出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mayday, mayday, mayday! - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.08,0:59:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮抢走了药液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Foot Clan have the purple ooze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.24,1:00:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在警察总部急需马上支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need backup at police headquarters right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.12,1:00:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,当心点儿 麦奇 马上到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang tight, Mikey. We'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.56,1:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.68,1:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得到上面的出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get above the exit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.00,1:00:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 我们不能露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy? We can't be seen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.36,1:00:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,药液是我们变成人类的唯一希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That purple ooze is our only shot at being normal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.52,1:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它就在我们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's heading toward the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.56,1:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.48,1:00:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟不跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You with me or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.84,1:00:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.68,1:01:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 你拿它干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph, what are you doing with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.24,1:01:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.16,1:01:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't move! Don't move! - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.60,1:01:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,把手亮出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me your hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.68,1:01:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.12,1:01:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跪在地上 - 等等 我们是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get down on the ground. - Wait! We're the good guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.44,1:01:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跪在地上 - 好吧 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get on the ground! - All right, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.76,1:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的同伙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.76,1:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是群怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.88,1:01:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是一群怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're monsters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.92,1:01:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.60,1:01:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No! Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.08,1:01:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it! No, don't! - Don't shoot, don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.48,1:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.52,1:01:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢跪在地上 跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the ground slowly. Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.56,1:01:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,琼斯 这玩笑可开大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones, you've got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.44,1:01:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们俩关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put these two in holding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.32,1:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,婕德 我们刚才所看到的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jade, what we just saw stays in the department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.64,1:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对公众要严密封锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The public doesn't need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.28,1:02:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是警方的监控器 他们在追捕你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is all over the police scanner, they are hunting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.96,1:02:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底是怎么回事 - 你说吧 拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened up there? - Tell him, Raph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他你是怎么坏了规矩把我们暴露的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him how you broke rank and got us all exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个极其自私的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the most selfish reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.72,1:02:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮差点儿就抢走了药液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Foot were gonna get their hands on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.24,1:02:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't know that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.44,1:02:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是侵入警察总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealing from police headquarters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.04,1:02:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可没有你被抓这一幕啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no scenario where you wouldn't get caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.32,1:02:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你从来没跟家人撒过谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe if you hadn't lied to your own flesh and blood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.96,1:02:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你对爱普尔撒谎那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. The way you lied to April?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.88,1:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在因为你的胡来 她在受罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now she's taking the fall for your mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.36,1:02:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到他们那种表情呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen the looks on their faces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.48,1:02:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那种惊恐的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't just scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.08,1:02:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我实在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.60,1:02:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不想再看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}actual hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be all right, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.52,1:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人类对未知的事物自然会感到恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People fear what they do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.80,1:02:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能就这样离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't walk away from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.00,1:02:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过他 斯普林特师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him, Master Splinter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.60,1:02:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可是拉斐尔根本就一个字都听不进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Raph, he never hears a word I have to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.44,1:02:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们都知道了关于药液的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I knew they couldn't handle the truth about the purple ooze,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.52,1:02:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可结果呢 他们证明我没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you know what, they proved me right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.52,1:02:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莱昂纳多 - 我没办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leonardo. - I don't know what to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.04,1:03:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼整天对着电脑 拉斐尔成天忙着健身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie's nose is in his computer, Raph's brains are in his biceps,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.92,1:03:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇呢 就会做白日梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mikey's head's in the clouds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.92,1:03:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法让他们步调一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get them all on the same page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.44,1:03:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To think with one mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.88,1:03:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不一定非得要大家想的都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't want them all to think the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.04,1:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有各取所长才能让集体更加强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their different points of view that make the team strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.56,1:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,称职的领导 要学会理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good leader understands this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.48,1:03:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,称职的兄长 要懂得宽容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good brother accepts it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.16,1:03:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我发现个情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys? I got something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.04,1:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说说吧 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to me, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.20,1:03:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑利用药液中的同位素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer's pinpointed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.36,1:03:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,精确地锁定了位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the isotopic signature of the purple ooze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.36,1:03:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我能找到比博和罗斯泰迪所在的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can track Bebop and Rocksteady's exact coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.56,1:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.16,1:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在海拔三万六千英尺 移动速度是490节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're at 36,000 feet, traveling at 490 knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.40,1:03:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这速度都能飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've achieved the power of flight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.00,1:03:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,挺厉害呀 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good for them, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.92,1:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在飞机上 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're on a plane, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.44,1:03:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们的两位变种朋友是要去巴西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like our mutant buddies are headed to Brazil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.56,1:03:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以从肯尼迪机场混上货运飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sneak onto the next cargo plane from JFK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.92,1:03:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是怪物 好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not monsters, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.72,1:03:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这城里真正的怪物是史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only real monster in this city is Shredder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.60,1:03:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,和他弄出来的两个变种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the two mutants that he's created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.08,1:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,比博和罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bebop and Rocksteady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.92,1:04:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你认为你所说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think anything coming out of your mouth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.36,1:04:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,能为她增加一些可信度 那你就大错特错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is gonna add to her credibility, you are sorely mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.92,1:04:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德是在巴克斯特·斯多克曼的帮助下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder mutated them with the help of Baxter Stockman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.56,1:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,使他们变异的 你真应该去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's actually who you need to go see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.08,1:04:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思 既然你提到斯多克曼博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny you should mention Dr. Stockman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.32,1:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我手里正好有一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we just finished analyzing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.24,1:04:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他交给我们的T.C.R.I.大厦监控画面 刚刚分析完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some security footage from TORI that he gave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.36,1:04:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 猜猜谁在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great. - Guess who's on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.08,1:04:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,事实不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.76,1:04:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,画面被改动过 重新编辑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That footage has been altered. It's been edited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.72,1:04:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们检查过真实性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We checked its authenticity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没改动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.64,1:04:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.44,1:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾地告诉你 因为那几个怪物闯入大厦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to break it to you, but all the phones have been shut down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.00,1:04:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,导致所有电话都不能使用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on account of monsters breaking into our stationhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.48,1:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我也遗憾地告诉你 按照法律规定 我有权打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hate to break it to you, but legally I'm entitled to a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.96,1:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我他们在哪 - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me where they are. - l don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.44,1:04:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就算知道我也不告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I did, I wouldn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.96,1:04:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,组长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh chief,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那些乌龟不是你该关注的重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the turtles are not the ones you should be chasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.28,1:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.12,1:05:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.68,1:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss, boss, we did it! We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.92,1:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了那个硬家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got that super-important-thingykind-of-hard-thing-to-find thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.96,1:05:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 把脸让开 老板看不到我了 老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move. Move your head over. He's got to see me. Hey, boss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.80,1:05:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们找到了最后一件 马上就回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have the final piece and are heading back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.28,1:06:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,激动人心的时刻终于开始倒计时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countdown to the big show is officially on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.40,1:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are ready for action!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.20,1:06:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都已经准备就绪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems are standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吗 史莱德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you taste it, Sensei Shredder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.56,1:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将要做的是多么伟大的事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The magnificence of what we're about to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.92,1:06:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yummy, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.08,1:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,难道就没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't there supposed to be, like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.04,1:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,比如空姐来送个热毛巾什么的服务吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pretty stewardesses handing out warm hand towels and stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.16,1:06:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是商务舱 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not down here, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.24,1:06:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.16,1:06:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 比博和罗斯泰迪已经返程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy. Bebop and Rocksteady are en route{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.64,1:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回纽约了 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- back to New York. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.16,1:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定已经找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have already retrieved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.56,1:06:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,打开时空之门所需要的东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last piece they needed to open the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.96,1:06:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能跟他们的飞机在空中相错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like our plane's about to cross over theirs, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.28,1:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿 好 来个三万英尺高空行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, with a 3,000-foot separation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.48,1:07:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以控制拦截 但我们得跳伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could plot a course for intercept, but we'd have to jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.20,1:07:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,跳伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.12,1:07:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.52,1:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不知道是要这样跳下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I don't know if this is such a good plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.72,1:07:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 别让我把你给看扁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, don't go getting soft on me now, Raph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.72,1:07:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 会很有意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.28,1:07:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,马上行动吧 航线重叠最多只有30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go now. We only have a 30-second window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.80,1:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.32,1:07:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dudes? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.04,1:07:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他跳下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He jumped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.36,1:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他跳下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He jumped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.76,1:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那就跳吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, one for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.32,1:07:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 没背降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait! You don't have a chute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.32,1:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用降落伞 我有滑板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a chute. I got my board!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.96,1:07:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,简直太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.96,1:08:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跳偏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.72,1:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 偏了 我要掉下去了 - 想搭顺风车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm off... I'm off target! - Need a lift, bro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.32,1:08:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 减速啊 麦奇 - 准备尖叫吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slow down, Mikey! - Prepare for the ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.36,1:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.40,1:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Mikey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.88,1:08:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.08,1:08:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Raph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay, you got this. You got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.80,1:08:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,范·迪塞尔会怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would Vin Diesel do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.12,1:08:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,永不后悔 绝不恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No regret, no fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.20,1:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,永不后悔 绝不恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No regret, no fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.48,1:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,永不后悔 绝不恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No regret... No fear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.64,1:09:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我既后悔又恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret this! Fear sucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.76,1:09:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他是不是落得有点儿太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't he coming in kind of fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.36,1:09:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.88,1:09:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,身手不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.08,1:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是 你们有降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The good news is you're wearing chutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.92,1:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.08,1:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,坏消息是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bad news is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.04,1:09:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这一定是他们从巴西弄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. This must be what they came to Brazil for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.76,1:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是打开时空之门需要的一部分东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the interdimensional portal-opening thingy-ma-bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.32,1:09:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,也许该给它起个好听点儿的名字 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's probably a more technical name for it, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.48,1:09:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.64,1:09:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.68,1:10:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你的发型不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude! Bringing back the Mohawk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.28,1:10:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你很配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.00,1:10:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢讽刺我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all got jokes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.32,1:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等我把你的脑袋砸烂 看你还怎么讽刺我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's see how funny you are after we bash your heads in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.96,1:10:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.16,1:10:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.92,1:10:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.48,1:10:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.40,1:10:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude! Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.44,1:10:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是我不对 我有点儿冲动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, that's my bad. I got a little carried away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.28,1:10:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我得手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.80,1:10:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我拿回来 - 我又失手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take that. - I don't got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 伙计们 我能控制住飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, guys, I'll level out the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.76,1:10:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还是一架敞篷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's no cockpit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.56,1:11:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当心 这里的东西随时都可能会移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, as some of the items may have shifted during flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.96,1:11:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing up there, Donnie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.68,1:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我这儿好极了 不能再好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is great. I'm doing awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.04,1:11:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是一只会飞的猪 - 莱昂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This pig is flying! - Leo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.28,1:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.64,1:12:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家都没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everyone okay? - I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.72,1:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.20,1:12:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 拉斐尔呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, where's Raph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.88,1:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,上岸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.76,1:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,上岸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land! Land! Land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.20,1:12:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让你见笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.92,1:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来比一下吧 宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rumble, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.28,1:13:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.32,1:13:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莱昂 不 - 当心点儿 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leo, no! - Eyes up, Donnie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.60,1:13:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,冲过去 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.16,1:13:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.88,1:13:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, I got it, I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.20,1:13:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.44,1:13:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢兄弟 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.76,1:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老伙计 - 老伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My man. - My man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.16,1:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 小王八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, turtles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.00,1:14:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这么友好 还说声再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice of them to say good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.76,1:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当心了 - 说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heads up! - Wait, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.88,1:14:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.04,1:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,步调真一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real team effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.44,1:14:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是非认定我们有罪 那就随便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna press charges, just press charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.24,1:14:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你还欠她一个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you still owe her a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.76,1:14:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不欠任何人任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't owe anybody anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.92,1:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你告诉我那些乌龟是从哪儿来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you tell me where those turtle things came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.00,1:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,新罕布什尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From New Hampshire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.72,1:14:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你比我想象的还不开窍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're actually even a bigger loser than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.88,1:14:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别被她的话干扰了 她是想要激怒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about her, Casey. She's just trying to get under your skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.24,1:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 她是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, she's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.04,1:15:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不止一个人这么说我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been hearing that my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我这辈子只有一个梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've only ever really had one goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.40,1:15:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要成为纽约警察局的一名探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to make detective in the New York City Police Department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.04,1:15:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能扫除罪犯 不仅仅是在监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to put criminals away, not just keep them in cages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.80,1:15:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在惩教署工作这么久只学会了两件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But working Corrections, you do learn two good things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.00,1:15:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,第一 审判不只有一种形式一个方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, justice comes in all shapes and sizes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.76,1:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.00,1:15:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,偷东西远比你想象中的要容易的多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's way easier to pick a cop's pocket than you might think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.12,1:15:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Vern...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.64,1:15:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'NeiI!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.60,1:15:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 听着 我想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, listen, I need you to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.16,1:15:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.76,1:15:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞了个小副业 猎鹰充气袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little side venture. Falcon breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.92,1:15:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现人们愿意花两百美元听个响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out, people are willing to pay $200 a pop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.12,1:15:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,买一口袋空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a bag of my hot air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.48,1:15:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 就当我没问过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, forget that I asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.96,1:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,凯西和我被关在警察局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casey and I are in police custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.84,1:16:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shocking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.12,1:16:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他们想采访你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would they want to question you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.44,1:16:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说是因为你闯入警察总部吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, just because you broke into their headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.36,1:16:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 现在有个问题比我的麻烦还大 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, look, I've got bigger problems than myself right now, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.96,1:16:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,巴克斯特·斯多克曼篡改了T.C.R.I.的监控画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baxter Stockman doctored the footage from TCRI,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.48,1:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我相信肯定有个备用监控器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm betting that there's some sort of a secondary feed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.64,1:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有完整的视频能证明他为史莱德工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will show that he's been working with Shredder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.32,1:16:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把比博和罗斯泰迪变成了变种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that they turned Bebop and Rocksteady into mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.48,1:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可为什么要找我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look... What do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.92,1:16:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你是个英雄 大家也都认为你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to be the hero that the whole city thinks you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.16,1:16:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请让一下 - 这里不对外开放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coming through. - It's a restricted area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.16,1:16:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不开放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Restricted"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.36,1:16:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我有个东西能打开这个城市的任何一扇门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I know something that will open just about any door in this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.96,1:16:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,城市钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.84,1:16:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是猎鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are The Falcon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.60,1:16:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没有资格大声说出我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't earned the respect yet to say my name out loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.52,1:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,想要拥有这个资格吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to put yourself on the path to that respect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.64,1:16:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,去楼下给我买杯摩卡奇诺吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}run downstairs and grab me a mochaccino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.36,1:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,备用监控器 到底会在哪儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secondary surveillance, where would you be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.88,1:17:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Vern...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.12,1:17:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,成名之前你可是个职业摄像师呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a cameraman before you got all fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.64,1:17:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一个摄像头 两个摄像头 三个摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One camera, two camera, three camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.44,1:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么没有第四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't there a fourth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.00,1:17:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,隐蔽摄像头 在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hidden camera. Bingo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.80,1:17:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,时间刚刚好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.08,1:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得袖手旁观 是一个英雄该做的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think standing on the sidelines makes you some kind of hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.52,1:18:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能那样从我身边硬挤过去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just push past me like that, bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.96,1:18:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前是笨蛋 永远都是笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were being a nitwit! You were gonna lose that thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.12,1:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时都抓住它了 可看你就好像我根本过不去一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had it right in my hand, and you acted like I wasn't even there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.56,1:18:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能随时都知道你们所在的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my job to make your presence known, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.64,1:18:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,应该随时保持沟通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of your head and communicate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.80,1:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别指望他了 只讲技术不懂战术的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you expect? He's all logic, no skills!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.20,1:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一个不守纪律的人还有脸说这种话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming from the guy who's all instinct, no restraint!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.60,1:18:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说吧 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, what do you know about anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这就叫有胆子没脑子 说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all heart and no brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.28,1:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你多懂了点儿战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you? You may know a lot about strategy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.00,1:18:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你懂感情吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you know nothing about feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.20,1:18:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.36,1:18:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就来说说感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know the one thing I am feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.12,1:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是很好的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may be brothers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.96,1:19:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但缺乏团队精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we are not a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.00,1:19:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们成功了 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's working! - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.08,1:19:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.64,1:19:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦能量达到峰值 时空之门将会开到最大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once it's fully powered, the portal will be just wide enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.04,1:19:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,科技堡垒就能源源不断地进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Technodrome to come through piece by piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.40,1:19:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那场面将会多壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be insane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.08,1:19:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,伽利略 埃塞克·牛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galileo... Isaac Newton...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.88,1:19:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·乔布斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve Jobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.40,1:19:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在科学史册上的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their names will be footnotes in the annals of science{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.48,1:19:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,应该都比不上这里发生的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after what's about to happen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.44,1:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,警官文森特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief Vincent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.00,1:20:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弗恩·芬威克 也许你听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Vern Fenwick. You might know me as The...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.04,1:20:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.72,1:20:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.00,1:20:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗克 那是谁 - 奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Rock, who is that? - O'Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.96,1:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快去抢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that canister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.12,1:20:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.20,1:20:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.56,1:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,猎鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Falcon."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.48,1:20:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.60,1:20:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.20,1:20:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,手法不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well played.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.12,1:20:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 又多了个犀牛和疣猪 麻烦还真不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. So I've got a rhino and a warthog to add to our troubles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.88,1:20:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good looking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.24,1:20:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.40,1:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,全城警戒通缉巴克斯特·斯多克曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want an APB on a Dr. Baxter Stockman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.72,1:20:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,另外再\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get a few...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.44,1:21:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,外面怎么回事 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening out there, Donnie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.52,1:21:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.52,1:22:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,史莱德成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.72,1:22:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,时空之门打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The portal's opening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.04,1:22:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 上帝 - 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.28,1:22:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那是从哪儿来的 上帝啊 太恐怖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did that come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.72,1:22:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,黑进他们的中央数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hacking into the main data core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.88,1:22:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 飞船的名字叫做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Ship's designate is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.28,1:22:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,科技堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Technodrome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.20,1:22:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对方指挥官的名字叫朗格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commanding Officer goes by the name of Krang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.44,1:23:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认识他 但我特别恨他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know that guy, but I hate that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.56,1:23:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他这飞船彻底完工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Krang were to finish building this thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.24,1:23:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不仅仅是船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it wouldn't just be a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.80,1:23:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,将是个战争机器 这里将生灵涂炭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be a war machine that would end all life here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.56,1:23:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,整个地球都无法幸免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.92,1:23:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们仍然有抗争的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is something we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.40,1:23:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,任何哺乳动物都是不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The atmosphere around the Technodrome would be toxic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.48,1:23:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在科技堡垒周围的大气层里 自由呼吸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to anyone with a standard cardiovascular system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.00,1:23:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.32,1:23:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们才能活着靠近时空之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may be the only ones who can survive around that portal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.68,1:23:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,才能无所顾忌地接近那艘科技堡垒去关掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only ones who can get close enough to this Technodrome to shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.60,1:23:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,警察还在抓我们呢 认为我们是怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how? We're being hunted. They think we're monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.96,1:23:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须取得警方的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we're gonna need the cops at our backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.24,1:23:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一直在搜捕我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trying to lock us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.72,1:23:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,除非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.68,1:23:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一小口 能让我们的内部保持不变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sip, and we'll stay the same on the inside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.20,1:23:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只是外形变成了人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but look like humans on the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.60,1:23:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的少年时代就要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boyhood is drawing to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,即将成为一名青年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are becoming young men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.48,1:23:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么选 自己决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.12,1:24:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我尊重你们的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do whatever you guys say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.80,1:24:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.40,1:24:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,确定他们会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sure they're coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.60,1:24:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.20,1:25:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要开枪 - 不要开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold your fire. - Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.28,1:25:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.20,1:25:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.64,1:25:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这个问题可有点复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not really into labels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.68,1:25:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有人叫我们怪物或者怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some call us freaks. Monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,简单地说 我们四兄弟来自纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say we're four brothers from New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.36,1:25:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,痛恨暴恐 热爱这座城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who hate bullies and love this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.52,1:25:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们是这座城市最大的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And right now, we're the city's best hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.80,1:25:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.12,1:25:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你用不着相信我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to take it from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.20,1:25:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,信他就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.20,1:25:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,说话呀 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Vern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.24,1:25:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说说你们的约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her about the arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.88,1:25:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么约定啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What arrangement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.96,1:25:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们的约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That... Arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.24,1:25:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 猎鹰还是猎鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, The Falcon is still The Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.12,1:25:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是接受过朋友的一点点帮助而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just may have gotten by with a little help from my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.48,1:26:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这四位就是第一次抓住史莱德的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These four are the ones who took Shredder down the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.36,1:26:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时只是开车的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was kind of more of a wingman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.88,1:26:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,为使这座城市摆脱黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been doing our part to protect this city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.80,1:26:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出过力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.40,1:26:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在我们更应该挺身而出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we think we have something to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.32,1:26:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们需要 - 策略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're gonna need... - Strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.64,1:26:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,直觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.60,1:26:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.16,1:26:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还要齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And boatloads of heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.76,1:26:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普尔 凯西还有弗恩需要护送到90号码头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April, Casey and Vern need an escort to Pier 90.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.68,1:26:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,时空之门的电磁波就是从那儿发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The electromagnetic force of the portal is coming from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.24,1:26:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我发给你具体的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forwarding you the coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.52,1:26:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a team!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.04,1:26:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们去克莱斯勒大厦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take us to the Chrysler Building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.44,1:26:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会登上朗格的飞船上 把他打回老家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make our way up to his ship and take down Krang on his home turf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.64,1:27:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快 奥尼尔 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, O'NeiI, get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.20,1:27:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你的盔甲安装了呼吸系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I installed a breathing apparatus in your helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.88,1:27:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以在科技堡垒的大气环境下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will help us survive the unique atmosphere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.00,1:27:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心呼吸问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the assembling Technodrome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.52,1:27:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还给你安装了一套手动传送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I made a handheld version of the teleportation devi...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.24,1:27:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们太伟大了 这是无可争辩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what we've done. This is undeniable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.28,1:27:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,后世将把我们奉若神明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be gods to future generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.16,1:27:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.08,1:27:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你还将是原来的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be just what you've always been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.60,1:27:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.52,1:27:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是蜡蚁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A footnote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.96,1:27:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 把他送回东京去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Take him to our facility in Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.60,1:27:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不能这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No! No! No! You can't do this to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.24,1:27:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你怎么 不 我对你忠心耿耿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you... No. No, you will... No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.68,1:27:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过我 不 我是个天才 你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done everything you asked! You promised! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.16,1:27:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我将名垂千古\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a legend! I will be... No! I will be a legend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.08,1:28:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot do this to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.36,1:28:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,世界会记住我的名字的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world will know my name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will ever know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.88,1:28:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,90秒后到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're 90 seconds out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.20,1:28:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的战术装备 武器 通讯器材全都准备就绪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got tactical gear, weapons, communications standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.88,1:28:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,掩护我们登上飞船就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we need is cover to get up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.56,1:28:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来我们需要找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we do, we've got to find that beacon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.20,1:28:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那个指引飞行器聚集的灯塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's drawing all those pieces together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.88,1:28:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能成功地搞定灯塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can send that beacon back to where it came from,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.88,1:28:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普尔 凯西还有弗恩就可以在我们的指令下关闭时空之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and April, Casey and Vern can close that portal on our command...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.56,1:28:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 永别了 科技堡垒 - 再见 朗格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good-bye, Technodrome. - Good-bye, Krang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.68,1:28:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Team effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.24,1:28:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,齐心协力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Team effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.20,1:28:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 他们分开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, they're splitting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.00,1:28:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们在跟着乌龟走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, we aren't going with the turtles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.24,1:28:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要跟他们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't we going with the turtles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.84,1:28:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一有什么事 你就只会想到那些乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When something bad happens, you want to be with the turtles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.40,1:29:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,朗格指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Krang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.88,1:29:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了 史莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, Shredder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.08,1:29:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你根本来不了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd never get here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.40,1:29:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,按你的要求 灯塔已经建好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you asked, the beacon has been set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.68,1:29:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦科技堡垒彻底完工 我们就能统治这个星球了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once the Technodrome reassembles, we can rule the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.36,1:29:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. "We"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.44,1:29:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We" will rule?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.64,1:29:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.92,1:29:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,合作得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We were a team!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.20,1:29:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜 合作结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teams are for the weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.12,1:29:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,搭档就是用来骗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family is for the scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.28,1:29:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,地球就是我的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth is my toy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.60,1:29:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢跟别人分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I do not like to share!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.52,1:29:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢耍我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.96,1:29:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我根本没把你当回事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I barely even thought about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.24,1:30:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,装到玩具箱里跟那些破玩具放在一起吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in the toy chest with the rest of the things I've broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.12,1:30:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,渺小的地球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly little earthling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.56,1:30:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真是可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.72,1:30:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,玩玩新游戏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now for a new game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.84,1:30:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小心了 地球人 游戏开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out, Earth! It's playtime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.64,1:30:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快跟上 前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.00,1:30:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快 各组迅速就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, move, move, move. Get your team in position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.96,1:30:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,盾牌准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shields up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.48,1:30:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 让他们进去吧 - 呈密集队形推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, let's get them in. - Tight form on that barricade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.96,1:30:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,走 继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.80,1:30:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,保持队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.72,1:30:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯西 - 坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Casey! - Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.08,1:31:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冲进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.04,1:31:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 当心 凯西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casey! Casey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.44,1:31:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西已经完成一大半了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's 57% complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.32,1:31:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果现在不阻止它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't stop it now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.40,1:31:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕几分钟后就来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's gonna be ready to go in less than four minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.56,1:31:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 还等什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, what are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.76,1:31:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能行吗 - 行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. You got this? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.12,1:31:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.40,1:31:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,冲浪开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surf's up, New York!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.96,1:32:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听见了吗 - 听见什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you hear that? - Hear what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.40,1:32:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,声音好奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounds strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.92,1:32:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比天上的外星人飞船还奇怪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like "alien spacecraft in the sky" strange?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.64,1:32:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.96,1:32:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是这种奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kind of strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.84,1:32:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,留点儿神 别让外人溜进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to keep our eyes out for intruders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.96,1:32:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,到底什么样的是外人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do intruders look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.00,1:32:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,除了疣猪和犀牛都是外人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody that's not a big pig ora big rhino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.48,1:32:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.12,1:32:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去控制传送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys secure the portal device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.96,1:32:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我对付他们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll deal with those two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.32,1:32:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,控制传送装置 你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Secure the portal device"? What does that even mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.52,1:32:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,意思就是搞定所有守卫的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means kick the butt of anyone that's guarding it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.32,1:32:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只要多尼一发信号 就关闭它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wait for Donnie's go signal, and shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.68,1:32:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可是都不知道有多少人在守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but we don't know how many people are guarding it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.48,1:32:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱俩换过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, do you want to switch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.44,1:33:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去控制装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no. We're gonna secure the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.32,1:33:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.84,1:33:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, fellas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.00,1:33:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还认识我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.64,1:33:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 原来是他呀 - 笨警察 你头不晕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look who it is. - Hey, cop, how's your noggin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.24,1:33:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来呀 - 如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.44,1:33:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了 宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.40,1:33:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,超声波扫描发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultrasonic scanners indicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.52,1:33:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔就在指挥舱前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the beacon's location is somewhere near the command module{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.68,1:33:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,几百英尺的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few hundred feet ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.84,1:33:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得阻止那东西完成组装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. We've got to stop this thing from completing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.84,1:33:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么才能阻止它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how are we supposed to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.72,1:33:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那就先拿他开刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start with whatever that thing is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.64,1:33:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定是朗格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must be Krang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.60,1:33:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 呈战斗队形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fall in, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.56,1:34:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还不算糟 破机器人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that bad, it's just a dumb robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.04,1:34:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比我想象的可差得远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was expecting way worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.36,1:34:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得应该是什么样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would that look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.80,1:34:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 也许应该有胡子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, like a moustache maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.32,1:34:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说邪恶的山羊胡什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evil goatee or something. You know what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.96,1:34:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就像嚼过的口香糖 还有脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a chewed-up piece of gum! With a face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.80,1:34:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只警告你们一次 从我的飞船上滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll only warn you once. Get off my ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.40,1:34:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 去控制台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, get to the console.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.80,1:34:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把这个讨厌的东西送回老家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's send this jacked-up disco ball back where it came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.92,1:34:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,口香糖先生 让我们看看你的本事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bubblicious, let's see what you've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.80,1:34:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会大开眼界的 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you what I've got! This!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.16,1:34:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙比我想象的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This dude's tougher than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.12,1:34:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你尽情地跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.92,1:34:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在比博的手里你是跑不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot escape the Bebop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.16,1:34:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.96,1:35:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 走啊 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Come on, Mikey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.16,1:35:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你完蛋了 朗格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down, Krang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.12,1:35:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, duck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.52,1:35:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 还有九十秒飞船就组装完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. About ninety seconds before this thing is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.84,1:35:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就看你的了 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.52,1:35:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pressure, no pressure, no pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.64,1:35:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的好期待能抓住你们几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm looking forward to enslaving you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.80,1:35:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,满满一笼子甲鱼肯定很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cage full of tortoises might be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.52,1:35:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是乌龟 不是什么甲鱼 根本不是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're turtles, not tortoises! There's a big difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.20,1:35:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对 神龟斩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Turtles bite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.16,1:35:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.28,1:35:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.48,1:35:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想不到我还有这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think I've got spares for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.40,1:35:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 他的手臂能自动修复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, he is literally rearming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.48,1:35:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了 蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha, pipsqueak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.72,1:36:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see him, Rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.04,1:36:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是跑不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you're here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多尼 - 再坚持十秒钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Donnie! - Just give me ten seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.68,1:36:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙实在太大了 我驾驭不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys? I don't think I'm tall enough to ride this ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.00,1:36:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这些愚蠢的小爬虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid reptiles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.12,1:36:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,莱昂 当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo, hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.44,1:36:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我认为最讨厌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're starting to be a real pain in my butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.40,1:36:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我是怎么对待讨厌的人的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you know what Bebop does with pains in his butt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.88,1:36:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 讨厌的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over here, little boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.40,1:36:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,放下你那破球杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down that popsicle stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.44,1:37:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛开始了 宝贝儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game on, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.92,1:37:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看 那就是传送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. There's the portal device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.60,1:37:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 她手上有剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. She has a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.24,1:37:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有轮毅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a hubcap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.24,1:37:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔在哪儿 多尼 时间不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the beacon, Donnie? We're running out of time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.92,1:37:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.24,1:37:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我摧毁你们的城市吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to watch your city crumble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.88,1:37:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, Donnie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.24,1:37:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我说对了 这是一个大能量武器系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was right. It's a massive weapons system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.80,1:37:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,朗格正在激活它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's bringing it online!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.52,1:37:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了 找到灯塔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! I found the beacon! It's just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.80,1:37:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.60,1:37:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦奇 上 - 好的 我来搞定那灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mikey, go! - I'll get that beacon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.36,1:37:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 小家伙们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, turtles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.12,1:37:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该上大餐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for the big guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.64,1:37:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏时间已经结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play time is over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.44,1:38:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm vertical!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.92,1:38:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想再刺激点儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.04,1:38:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.76,1:38:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他 罗克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, Rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.24,1:38:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.28,1:38:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.28,1:38:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗克 - 怎么 比博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rock. - Yeah, Beebs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.32,1:39:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也许下次应该扔回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe next time, throw it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.12,1:39:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.44,1:39:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Heads up, Donnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.44,1:39:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beacon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.32,1:39:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧 你这小乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, little turtle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.04,1:39:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来跟我拥抱一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me give you a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.24,1:39:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,说再见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.60,1:39:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.24,1:39:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph! With me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.24,1:39:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮帮我 伙计们 - 坚持住 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Little help, guys! - Hang on, little bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.92,1:40:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没人可以随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody messes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.76,1:40:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,动我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Mikey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.00,1:40:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.88,1:40:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 朗格完蛋了 但飞船还在组装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, Krang is down, but his ship's still building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.76,1:40:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.56,1:40:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,无人机就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drone activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.28,1:40:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要闭合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.96,1:40:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.00,1:40:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了 好了 伙计们 我们该下去关闭时空之门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, let's get off this ship and get that portal closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.04,1:41:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们已经到站了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is our stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.20,1:41:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 准备去关闭时空之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, get ready to close the portal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.24,1:41:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来的 乌龟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back, turtles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.44,1:41:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就等着我的报复吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a thousand times stronger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.68,1:41:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭发送器 听见了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the portal! Close the portal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.44,1:41:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 快动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, are you there? Guys, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.68,1:41:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭发送装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the portal now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.28,1:41:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cool. It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.96,1:41:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我就知道能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I knew that would work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.08,1:41:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你真觉得我们四个少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, so you seriously thought us four teenagers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.68,1:41:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,能拯救整个世界吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could save the whole world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.12,1:42:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.24,1:42:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这世上独一无二的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we got something no one else has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.60,1:42:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 神龟的力量 - 垃圾清扫车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turtle power! - Garbage truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.52,1:42:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾清扫车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garbage truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.20,1:42:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是这个 我觉得应该喊 - 再想想 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, we do have one. - The other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.88,1:42:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,神龟的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turtle power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.60,1:42:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,日前逃脱的罪犯比博和罗斯泰迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escaped convicts Bebop and Rocksteady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.40,1:42:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,已经被成功的缉拿归案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are now in police custody,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.96,1:42:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而巴克斯特·斯多克曼博士仍然在逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while Dr. Baxter Stockman remains at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.44,1:42:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,官方正式宣布城市已经重获安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Authorities assure us that the city is once again safe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.04,1:42:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但是上周的事件仍然留下许多疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}however questions remain about last week's events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.04,1:42:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,天空中出现的到底是什么 是怎么出现在我们这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that threat from the sky and how exactly was it averted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.08,1:42:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过最大的问题是我们该不该考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the bigger question is, does it even matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.32,1:42:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们的英雄一个合法的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we need to give our heroes a name and a face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.76,1:42:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还是仅仅知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it enough to know that they're out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.80,1:42:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他在黑暗之中守护着我们就够了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching over us from the shadows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.52,1:42:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为了表彰你们为城市作出的贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your incredible valor within this community,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.20,1:42:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,同时也是你们跟警方密切合作的鼓励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for your uncompromising cooperation with this agency,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.60,1:42:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,特授予你们城市金钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I present to you the keys to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.80,1:42:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,象征着我们的赞赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a symbol of our appreciation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.88,1:42:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,和尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}respect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.92,1:42:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,献给我们的英雄们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for our continued partnership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.04,1:43:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是英雄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To you brothers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.92,1:43:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,莱昂纳多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonardo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.28,1:43:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 多纳泰罗 米开朗基罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raphael, Donatello, Michelangelo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.52,1:43:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有姓吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.60,1:43:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.72,1:43:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还真没想过 不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought of that. That's no fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.96,1:43:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺英雄们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.04,1:43:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有一个 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got one of those. No big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.16,1:43:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮过他们 我们是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped them. They're friends of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.72,1:43:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下周有什么安排吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you got plans next weekend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.84,1:43:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一般就是打冰球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just my regular hockey game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.72,1:43:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你想来看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to come watch me play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.32,1:43:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 我要跟你一对一打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch? I'll take you one on one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.92,1:43:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你会输得很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll kick your butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.24,1:43:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我很期待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.16,1:43:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 我的钥匙最大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My key's totally bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.24,1:43:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,比你们的都大 我的最大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bigger than your key, man. I got the big key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.32,1:44:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你们应该多露露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you should give people more credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.68,1:44:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大家已经接受你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll accept you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.44,1:44:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're probably right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.32,1:44:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.96,1:44:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定我们还是应该遵守约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we'll stick with the arrangement we've had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.76,1:44:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,需要我们的时候 爱普尔知道去哪儿找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever need us, April knows where to find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.32,1:44:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.00,1:44:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以过上正常的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could live a normal life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.20,1:44:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.36,1:44:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.52,1:44:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那多没意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What fun is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.28,1:44:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
